window.CET6_DATA("data/articles/day-046.json",{"day":46,"title":"The Decisions Behind a River Festival","targetWords":[{"word":"speculate","gloss":"推测","context":"A riverside town began to speculate about hosting a festival after years of disappointing summers.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"undertake","gloss":"承担","context":"Its council agreed to undertake a small event that would encourage residents to cherish the river.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"cherish","gloss":"珍惜","context":"Its council agreed to undertake a small event that would encourage residents to cherish the river.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"emit","gloss":"排放","context":"Generators could emit noise and fumes, so organizers could not skip an environmental assessment.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"skip","gloss":"跳过","context":"Generators could emit noise and fumes, so organizers could not skip an environmental assessment.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"dump","gloss":"倾倒","context":"Vendors must not dump waste beside the water, even if a lightweight container would float harmlessly at first.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"float","gloss":"漂浮","context":"Vendors must not dump waste beside the water, even if a lightweight container would float harmlessly at first.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"fold","gloss":"折叠","context":"Volunteers would fold reusable bags for visitors, and a coordinator threatened to resign if safety became a decoration.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"resign","gloss":"辞职","context":"Volunteers would fold reusable bags for visitors, and a coordinator threatened to resign if safety became a decoration.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"scratch","gloss":"刮伤","context":"A scratch on a sample sign seemed minor; a notice that failed to spell an emergency instruction clearly was a more serious fault.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"spell","gloss":"拼写","context":"A scratch on a sample sign seemed minor; a notice that failed to spell an emergency instruction clearly was a more serious fault.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"contradict","gloss":"与之矛盾","context":"Promotional claims should not contradict the practical plan.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":{"en":"contradict the evidence","zh":"与证据矛盾"}},{"word":"coordinate","gloss":"协调","context":"The committee would coordinate transport and elect a representative from each neighborhood.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"elect","gloss":"选举","context":"The committee would coordinate transport and elect a representative from each neighborhood.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"hint","gloss":"提示","context":"A brief hint on a map could help people find quiet areas, but everyone needed to obey restrictions near deep water.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"obey","gloss":"遵守","context":"A brief hint on a map could help people find quiet areas, but everyone needed to obey restrictions near deep water.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"seize","gloss":"抓住","context":"Businesses hoped to seize the opportunity, while musicians hoped to stir interest and amuse children.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"stir","gloss":"激起","context":"Businesses hoped to seize the opportunity, while musicians hoped to stir interest and amuse children.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"amuse","gloss":"逗乐","context":"Businesses hoped to seize the opportunity, while musicians hoped to stir interest and amuse children.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"bite","gloss":"咬","context":"Staff reminded parents that excited animals might bite.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"depict","gloss":"描绘","context":"A painting exhibition would depict the river's changing history, and residents could furnish old photographs.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"furnish","gloss":"提供","context":"A painting exhibition would depict the river's changing history, and residents could furnish old photographs.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"linger","gloss":"逗留","context":"People might linger over a picture long after hearing a speech.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"stroke","gloss":"划桨动作","context":"A rowing display demonstrated how a controlled stroke moved a boat more effectively than frantic effort.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"intervene","gloss":"干预","context":"Instructors would intervene if beginners lost balance.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"shine","gloss":"发光","context":"Afternoon light could shine on the current and make distances difficult to judge, so trained guides would steer every group.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"steer","gloss":"引导","context":"Afternoon light could shine on the current and make distances difficult to judge, so trained guides would steer every group.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"tempt","gloss":"诱使","context":"Attractive scenery must not tempt spectators into unsafe positions.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"allocate","gloss":"分配","context":"The council had to allocate equipment fairly and delegate responsibilities in writing.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"delegate","gloss":"委派","context":"The council had to allocate equipment fairly and delegate responsibilities in writing.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"dive","gloss":"潜水","context":"Nobody could dive into the river simply to grab a dropped hat.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"grab","gloss":"抓","context":"Nobody could dive into the river simply to grab a dropped hat.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"hop","gloss":"单脚跳","context":"Children could hop along the marked games area, kick a ball away from the bank, or pat a visiting dog after asking its owner, but activities had to remain separated from boat traffic.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"kick","gloss":"踢","context":"Children could hop along the marked games area, kick a ball away from the bank, or pat a visiting dog after asking its owner, but activities had to remain separated from boat traffic.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"pat","gloss":"轻拍","context":"Children could hop along the marked games area, kick a ball away from the bank, or pat a visiting dog after asking its owner, but activities had to remain separated from boat traffic.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"violate","gloss":"违反","context":"To violate a rule would place others at risk, not merely challenge authority.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"wrap","gloss":"包裹","context":"Sellers would wrap food hygienically, and organizers must not betray public trust by hiding a failed inspection.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"betray","gloss":"背叛","context":"Sellers would wrap food hygienically, and organizers must not betray public trust by hiding a failed inspection.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"creep","gloss":"缓慢上升","context":"Costs could creep upward, so the treasurer needed a firm grip on invoices.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"grip","gloss":"把握","context":"Costs could creep upward, so the treasurer needed a firm grip on invoices.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"postpone","gloss":"推迟","context":"The committee would postpone an activity if conditions changed.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"reckon","gloss":"认为","context":"It was reasonable to reckon that rain might arrive, and flexible tents could bend without collapsing.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"bend","gloss":"弯曲","context":"It was reasonable to reckon that rain might arrive, and flexible tents could bend without collapsing.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"crawl","gloss":"爬行","context":"An inspection required someone to crawl beneath the temporary stage; a cheerful advertisement should not distort that unglamorous work.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"distort","gloss":"歪曲","context":"An inspection required someone to crawl beneath the temporary stage; a cheerful advertisement should not distort that unglamorous work.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"indulge","gloss":"纵容","context":"The event could indulge curiosity while still following the ordinary discipline that made enjoyment possible.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"rotate","gloss":"轮换","context":"Volunteers agreed to rotate tasks rather than drag exhausted colleagues through a long shift.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"drag","gloss":"拖","context":"Volunteers agreed to rotate tasks rather than drag exhausted colleagues through a long shift.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"glimpse","gloss":"一瞥","context":"A visitor might catch only a glimpse of the preparations, yet those decisions shaped the whole experience.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"mend","gloss":"修补","context":"Afterward, workers would mend damaged fencing and restore the bank before discussing another festival.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null}],"paragraphs":[{"en":"A riverside town began to speculate about hosting a festival after years of disappointing summers. Its council agreed to undertake a small event that would encourage residents to cherish the river. Generators could emit noise and fumes, so organizers could not skip an environmental assessment. Vendors must not dump waste beside the water, even if a lightweight container would float harmlessly at first. Volunteers would fold reusable bags for visitors, and a coordinator threatened to resign if safety became a decoration. A scratch on a sample sign seemed minor; a notice that failed to spell an emergency instruction clearly was a more serious fault.","zh":"多年夏季活动令人失望后，河边小镇开始考虑举办节庆。议会同意承办一场小型活动，鼓励居民珍惜河流。发电机可能排放噪声和废气，因此组织者不能跳过环保评估。摊主不可在水边倒垃圾，即使轻质容器最初看似无害地漂浮着。志愿者为来访者折好可重复使用的袋子，一位协调员威胁说，若安全仅成了摆设，她就辞职。示范标识上的划痕似乎不严重，但告示若未能把紧急指令写清，问题就大得多。"},{"en":"Promotional claims should not contradict the practical plan. The committee would coordinate transport and elect a representative from each neighborhood. A brief hint on a map could help people find quiet areas, but everyone needed to obey restrictions near deep water. Businesses hoped to seize the opportunity, while musicians hoped to stir interest and amuse children. Staff reminded parents that excited animals might bite. A painting exhibition would depict the river's changing history, and residents could furnish old photographs. People might linger over a picture long after hearing a speech. The festival therefore needed space for reflection, as well as organized entertainment.","zh":"宣传说法不应与实际方案相矛盾。委员会会协调交通，从每个社区选出一位代表。地图上的简短提示可以帮助人们找到安静区域，但所有人必须遵守深水附近的限制。企业希望抓住机会，音乐人希望激起兴趣、逗孩子开心。工作人员提醒家长，受刺激的动物可能咬人。绘画展将描绘河流历史的变化，居民也能提供旧照片。人们看一幅画可能比听一篇讲话停留更久。因此，节庆既需要有组织的娱乐，也需要反思空间。"},{"en":"A rowing display demonstrated how a controlled stroke moved a boat more effectively than frantic effort. Instructors would intervene if beginners lost balance. Afternoon light could shine on the current and make distances difficult to judge, so trained guides would steer every group. Attractive scenery must not tempt spectators into unsafe positions. The council had to allocate equipment fairly and delegate responsibilities in writing. Nobody could dive into the river simply to grab a dropped hat. Children could hop along the marked games area, kick a ball away from the bank, or pat a visiting dog after asking its owner, but activities had to remain separated from boat traffic.","zh":"划船展示说明，受控的一次划桨，比慌乱用力更有效。初学者失去平衡时，教练会干预。午后阳光照在水流上，可能让距离难以判断，因此每组都由受训向导带领。美景不应诱使观众进入危险位置。议会必须公平分配设备，并书面委派职责。任何人不能只为捡帽子就跳入河中。孩子可以在划定游戏区单脚跳、在远离河岸处踢球，或经主人许可后轻拍来访的狗，但这些活动必须与船只通行分开。"},{"en":"To violate a rule would place others at risk, not merely challenge authority. Sellers would wrap food hygienically, and organizers must not betray public trust by hiding a failed inspection. Costs could creep upward, so the treasurer needed a firm grip on invoices. The committee would postpone an activity if conditions changed. It was reasonable to reckon that rain might arrive, and flexible tents could bend without collapsing. An inspection required someone to crawl beneath the temporary stage; a cheerful advertisement should not distort that unglamorous work. The event could indulge curiosity while still following the ordinary discipline that made enjoyment possible.","zh":"违反规则会让他人承受风险，而不只是挑战权威。商贩会卫生地包好食物，组织者也不可隐瞒检查不合格、背叛公众信任。费用可能缓慢增加，因此财务负责人必须牢牢把握发票。情况变化时，委员会会推迟活动。认为可能下雨是合理的，柔性帐篷可以弯曲而不倒塌。检查需要有人爬到临时舞台下面；轻松快乐的广告不应歪曲这些不起眼的工作。活动可以满足好奇心，同时遵守让享受成为可能的日常纪律。"},{"en":"Volunteers agreed to rotate tasks rather than drag exhausted colleagues through a long shift. A visitor might catch only a glimpse of the preparations, yet those decisions shaped the whole experience. Afterward, workers would mend damaged fencing and restore the bank before discussing another festival. The council found that a small event could attract people without treating the river as an unlimited resource. Its lasting value lay in a better understanding of collective responsibility: pleasure did not require ignoring limits, and good organization was not the enemy of spontaneity. It was what allowed a shared occasion to remain generous, welcoming, and safe.","zh":"志愿者同意轮换任务，而不把筋疲力尽的同事拖过长班次。来访者可能只瞥见准备工作的片段，但这些决定塑造了整个体验。结束后，工人会先修补受损围栏、恢复河岸，再讨论下一次节庆。议会发现，小活动也能吸引人们，不必把河流当作无限资源。其持久价值在于更好理解共同责任：快乐不需要无视限制，良好组织也不是自发性的敌人，恰恰是它让共享活动保持慷慨、友好和安全。"}],"previous":45,"next":47});
